rgs":[234,65535,2,0,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&虞汜\n薛珝和陶璜那两个混蛋，居然把我一个人\n丢到这里。\n&虞汜\n这里草木茂盛，东边又有山，怎么看都\n可能被偷袭呀。我可不想变成下一个刘\n俊或者修则。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,16,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,20,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,11,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,22,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,13,0]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1049],[]]},"end":67},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,28,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,251,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&霍弋\n哈，居然孤军扎营在这种地方，东吴的\n将领还真是低能。\n&霍弋\n就算北面有军队驻防，两地相隔太远，\n中间又隔着大河，你怎么来救？\n&刘敏\n我总觉得怪怪的，驻防在南岸的人太少了\n，似乎像完全放弃这营地的样子。\n&张嶷\n刘将军说得对，我也认为他们故意放弃\n这里的兵马，为的就是要引我们出来。\n&关索\n这么说，敌人也想要决战？\n&张嶷\n看样子是如此，他们的补给线拉得太长\n，在此地又不得人心，很容易发生粮草\n短缺的问题。\n&花鬘\n那为什么不等到敌人缺粮再攻？\n&刘敏\n因为吕兴的残党向我们求救，如果还在\n继续观望，只怕交州人会对我们失望。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1049]]},"end":72},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张嶷\n正是如此，我们就放胆攻吧，孟琰不久\n之后就会抵达，请放心。\n&霍弋\n嘿嘿嘿，这次让那些吴贼知道我谋将\n霍弋的真正本领。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[584,584,"准备迎击？"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[725,725,"再等一下，我们有另外的援军。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[584,584,"有援军不告诉自己人，这样作战的连系\n会完全被破坏掉…说笑的…"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[725,725,"谅你这小子也不敢再啰嗦，要骗过敌人，\n得先骗过自己人…"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[118]},{"op":25,"name":"victory_cond_text","args":["胜利条件\n一﹑全灭敌人。\n\n失败条件\n一﹑我军全灭。\n二、孟琰或毛炅阵亡。\n二﹑回合数超过30。"]},{"op":26,"name":"battle_goal_text","args":["一﹑全灭敌人。"]},{"op":90,"name":"ui_5a","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_result","args":[1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":1,"offset":13670,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":13672,"title":"ね瓁北��","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["ね瓁北��"]},{"op":63,"name":"test_turn","args":[1,0]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":119,"name":"int_var_op","args":[2,0,2,0,7]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,28,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,412,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,251,32]},{"op":120,"name":"data_transfer","args":[0,1,414,32]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":1,"offset":13817,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,1,2,1,0,0,23,13]},{"op":64,"name":"test_side","args":[0]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[16,1049]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,28,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,412,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,251,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,414,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孟琰\n好，多亏你的带路，总算是绕到敌军\n背后了。真没想到建宁毛家也会出你\n这样的优秀人才。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&毛炅\n孟将军不必客气，我才应该感谢您出手\n相助，我们才能有机会收复交州。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[725,8,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&薛珝\n陶璜，你这家伙在干什么，怎么后方\n还有敌人？\n&陶璜\n这都是属下的过错…\n&薛珝\n知道就好。\n&陶璜\n骗你的…无能的主帅就该死，你以为我\n真的会理你？\n&陶璜\n要是为了救你，害交州部队覆灭，那我们\n才真的完了。\n&薛珝\n陶璜！！！"]},{"op":77,"name":"unit_op_4d","args":[0,725,0,0,0,0,0,6,1,0,65535,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孟琰\n只要打掉敌人主将，占领他们本营，敌人\n就会全军大乱。\n&孟琰\n自从五丈原之后，就没打过一场像样的仗\n，今天就让我来好好一显身手。"]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[16,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":2,"offset":14606,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,0,2,0,0,0,7,19]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[18]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,584,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,725,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&薛珝\n看着吧，愚蠢的贼军。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,190,0]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[1049],[]]},"end":11},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,446,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,447,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,448,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,449,0]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,450,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,451,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,452,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,453,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&沈莹\n花了一点时间绕到敌人侧面，不过总算是\n顺利赶到。\n&陶璜\n丹阳兵？\n&薛珝\n山战莫过于山越人，唯有山越可克南中\n部队，你这丹阳人应该很了解吧。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":80,"name":"unit_status","args":[725,6,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&薛珝\n现在全军出击！\n&陶璜\n现在是不是太急了？\n&薛珝\n现在不攻击还等何时？你是统帅还是我是\n统帅？\n&陶璜\n开开玩笑罢了，长官的命令只有遵从。"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,858,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,859,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,860,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,861,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,862,0]},{"op":85,"name":"unit_move","args":[0,261,0,15,13,2]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,262,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,263,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,264,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,265,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,266,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,267,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,268,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,269,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,270,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,271,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,272,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,286,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,287,0]},{"op":76,"name":"unit_op_4c","args":[0,288,0]},{"op":76,"name