"end":84},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[28,28,"霍弋你这家伙，这样的情况你考虑过了\n吗？"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[13,13,"说真的，当然没有。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[28,28,"你这浑蛋，是要我们跟着你一起送死吗？"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[251,251,"孟将军稍安勿躁，敌人虽然兵力强大，\n但终究不熟悉在此地作战，我们还是\n稍占有地利。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[28,28,"下次再出这种包，绝对把你们一行人\n都丢到毒泉里。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[1049]]},"end":87},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&关索\n现在要撤退吗？\n&霍弋\n不，我们也有援军。\n&霍弋\n敌人现在为了攻击我们，会几乎全军出动\n，只要后方一空，就是我们的机会了。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[18,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":3,"offset":16840,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":65,"name":"test_units_in_area","args":[2,0,2,0,0,0,7,19]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[18],[19]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[13,13,"好，这次拿下交州，可以把赌场生意拓展\n到这里了。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[20,20,"你在说什么？"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[16,16,"真是道德败坏，居然说出这种话来。"]},{"op":21,"name":"unit_say","args":[13,13,"死关索，下次来我这叫小姐的时候就别\n叫我打折。"]},{"op":89,"name":"op_59","args":[1000,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":73,"name":"ui_49","args":[]},{"op":13,"name":"next_scene","args":[]},{"op":11,"name":"set_flag","args":[19,1]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]},{"index":4,"offset":17159,"title":"驹い矪竚","conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["驹い矪竚"]},{"op":46,"name":"test_adjacent","args":[22,190,1]},{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[],[14]]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[22,190,65535,65535,1,0]},{"op":79,"name":"unit_op_4f","args":[190,22,65535,65535,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&张嶷\n想不到又碰到你了。\n&沈莹\n早就想好好跟你打一场了。"]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":[""]},"end":40},{"op":104,"name":"duel_setup","args":[22,190,